				)
			)
		)
		(property "Design Notes" "Feedback divider R6 100k / R7 13.7k sets about 4.95 V assuming VREF 0.596 V (verify in datasheet), C16 68 pF feed-forward across R6; L1 15 uH; C15 100 nF bootstrap BOOT-SW; C14 22 uF input, C17 47 uF output; EN pin currently flagged no-connect - confirm datasheet allows floating EN, otherwise tie to VIN"
